n here: https://speedrun.a16z.com/apply <https://speedrun007.a16z.com/jm> <<<\\r\\n \\r\\ndeadline is may 17. apps submitted by apr 27 get reviewed early.\\r\\nprogram runs jul 27 to oct 11. it’s fully in person in sf.\\r\\n \\r\\nif you know someone else who’s been thinking about building, feel free to pass this along.\\r\\n \\r\\n–– andrew\\r\\n \\r\\nGeneral Partner, a16z\\r\\n2865 Sand Hill Rd Suite 101, Menlo Park CA 94025\\r\\n \\r\\nfyi lots and lots of info below \\r\\n \\r\\n--\\r\\n \\r\\nwhat is speedrun?\\r\\n\\r\\n- a16z invests up to $1m in each company\\r\\n- 12-week program, jul–oct 2026, all in sf\\r\\n- expert sessions, workshops, office hours, and demo day prep\\r\\n\\r\\nwhy join?\\r\\n\\r\\n- $5m+ in perks: aws, gcp, openai, anthropic, nvidia, stripe, deel, and more\\r\\n- help with recruiting, brand/marketing, creator strategy, and biz dev\\r\\n- direct access to our capital + network\\r\\n\\r\\nwho should apply?\\r\\n\\r\\n- early stage founders (solo or teams)\\r\\n- we don’t care about pedigree, we care about bold ideas and execution\\r\\n- already raised? no problem - we fund pre-seed to seed\\r\\n\\r\\nfaq highlights\\r\\n\\r\\n- applications are reviewed every 2 weeks\\r\\n- process: app then quick video pitch or short call → fast decisions\\r\\n- yes, solo founders can apply\\r\\n- yes, if you’re already funded you can still join (network + mentorship matter just as much as capital)\\r\\n- program is in person - it’s the best way to get value, but again we’ll work with specific circumstances\\r\\n\\r\\ntrack record so far\\r\\n\\r\\n- 200+ startups funded since 2023\\r\\n- >$200m deployed\\r\\n\\r\\n>>> apply to speedrun here: https://speedrun.a16z.com/apply <https://speedrun007.a16z.com/jm> <<<\\r\\n \\r\\napps for sf close may 17 at 11:59 pm pt\\r\\nearly review deadline apr 27\\r\\n\",\n  \"attachments\": [],\n  \"_mcp_structured\": {\n    \"structuredContent\": {\n      \"citation\": {\n        \"title\": \"Gmail\",\n        \"url\": \"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#all/19db594d03c6b5d1\",\n        \"icon\": \"https://www.gstatic.com/marketing-cms/assets/images/66/ac/14b165e647fd85c824bfbe5d6bc5/gmail.webp\",\n        \"previewTitle\": \"Fwd: speedrun007 apps open - up to $1M in pre-seed/seed startups\",\n        \"source\": \"Gmail\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"version\": \"1.0\",\n      \"source\": \"mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}"}],"tool_use_id":"call_function_okwtmfbxqvfo_1"}
